        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "42ea2944-f13d-3c6c-8a38-240d2437bcdf",
                "word": "гипотетически",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c4430de-c369-39c1-bb79-01fc982daec3",
                        "entry_id": "42ea2944-f13d-3c6c-8a38-240d2437bcdf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к гипотетический; предположительно, исходя из каких-либо гипотез"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4b4aa31-e836-4c57-9f50-29127d6b8154",
                                "sense_id": "2c4430de-c369-39c1-bb79-01fc982daec3",
                                "text": "Императивы вообще повелевают или гипотетически (условно), или категорически (изъявительно)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f97efee-0cd2-4160-ac40-4f6d76d131b2",
                                "sense_id": "2c4430de-c369-39c1-bb79-01fc982daec3",
                                "text": "Умение рассуждать гипотетически и рассматривать своё суждение как гипотезу, нуждающуюся ещё в проверке, составляет самую показательную особенность зрелой мысли; отсутствие этой способности — самую симптоматическую черту мышления ребенка."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7415a3b9-5ee9-4fac-8fbf-a43c42ed1a59",
                        "source_entry_id": "42ea2944-f13d-3c6c-8a38-240d2437bcdf",
                        "source_sense_id": "2c4430de-c369-39c1-bb79-01fc982daec3",
                        "target_lang_word": "hypothetically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hypothetically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b913f58-7eb2-319d-a1f9-091b66ee45db",
                                        "entry_id": "8232b998-48d4-3ecf-8325-8f3a66ffa034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a hypothetical way; as a hypothesis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "170108b6-b709-4a3a-838b-4fab2951aa7a",
                                                "sense_id": "9b913f58-7eb2-319d-a1f9-091b66ee45db",
                                                "text": "He offered the proposition hypothetically."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f0f093b-e5bd-467f-9ce5-009669fbccbe",
                                                "sense_id": "9b913f58-7eb2-319d-a1f9-091b66ee45db",
                                                "text": "Donald Trump’s lawyer Rudy Giuliani claimed Sunday that the President hypothetically could have shot the former FBI director to end the Russia investigation and not face prosecution for it while in office."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce54795a-61fa-37c7-ad5a-16e1783d50e0",
                                        "entry_id": "8232b998-48d4-3ecf-8325-8f3a66ffa034",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to introduce a proposition to discussion without commitment to its truth"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "475e0885-c2f6-4db7-b841-ef05e5978ad5",
                                                "sense_id": "ce54795a-61fa-37c7-ad5a-16e1783d50e0",
                                                "text": "Hypothetically, what would you say if I proposed marriage to you?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58bddfa0-c993-434e-b18a-14e4a02b6291",
                                                "sense_id": "ce54795a-61fa-37c7-ad5a-16e1783d50e0",
                                                "text": "Hypothetically, Srinivasan suggests network states for people who eat specific diets (kosher, keto), for people who don’t like FDA regulation, for people who don’t like cancel culture, for people who want to live like Benedictine monks, for people who might want to limit internet use by putting public buildings in Faraday cages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
